What:		/proc/oplus_scheduler/audio/enable
What:		/proc/oplus_scheduler/audio/debug
What:		/proc/oplus_scheduler/audio/status
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
	OnePlus sched_assist audio control plane. The enable node gates audio
	classification, debug reports marked audio tasks when requested, and
	status activates runtime AudioBoost policy. With status active, marked
	threads receive the donor light-UX treatment and bounded timer slack.
	Marked real-time threads also avoid candidate CPUs whose active idle
	state has an exit latency above the donor threshold of 60 microseconds.
